OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start, but cloud
OL,6,Fbuilding in the west, with a few spots
OL,7,Fof rain possible across the Peak
OL,8,FDistrict during the afternoon.
OL,9,FElsewhere remaining dry, with sunny
OL,10,Fspells developing and feeling warm in
OL,11,Fthe sunshine. Light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable cloud and clear
OL,14,Fspells overnight, with a risk of
OL,15,Fisolated mist and fog patches
OL,16,Fdeveloping towards the end of the
OL,17,Fnight. Mild with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
