OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry but largely cloudy on
OL,6,FTuesday, with some bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Feeling warm in any sunshine
OL,8,Fthat develops, with winds remaining
OL,9,Flight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,12,Fon Wednesday with outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fdeveloping, heavy at times. Rain
OL,14,Fclearing overnight, followed by a fine
OL,15,Fand sunny Thursday after a chilly
OL,16,Fstart. Further rain possible on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
